//! HTTP Framework — NestJS-style building blocks.
//!
//! Organized into a sub-module to keep the HTTP root clean.
//! The HTTP root (std::http) contains the server, router, client, and protocol.
//! This sub-module (std::http::framework) contains the API framework layer.
//!
//! | Module | NestJS Equivalent |
//! |--------|-------------------|
//! | `json_response` | Structured JSON responses |
//! | `middleware` | Middleware pipeline (app.use) |
//! | `guard` | Guards (@UseGuards) |
//! | `pipe` | Pipes (@UsePipes) |
//! | `exception` | Exception filters (@Catch) |
//! | `interceptor` | Interceptors (@UseInterceptors) |

pub mod json_response
pub mod middleware
pub mod guard
pub mod pipe
pub mod exception
pub mod interceptor
